                                              actually use.
  etil2jz/etil-minecraft-flags  no licence    A widely copied variant of Aikar's
                                              flags, unmaintained since 2022,
                                              which is part of why stale flags
                                              keep turning up in start scripts.
  PaperMC/docs                  BSD-2-Clause  The documentation the flag rules cite,
                                              and a start-script generator that
                                              covers the same ground from the other
